=\"1\">′</mo></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nsatisfies (P2) of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"prp-order-from-positives\">@prp-order-from-positives</span>,\nand that it does not satisfy (P1). Which part of (P1) fails?</p>","file":"ch2/ordered-rings.html"}